1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,959
Hal qof oo jiran… wuxuu u gudbin karaa 18 qof. Fayraskiisuna hawada ayuu ku sii jiraa laba saacadood. Waa jadeecada.

2
00:00:08,059 --> 00:00:13,972
Jadeecadu waa fayras ku faafa neefta, qufaca iyo hindhisada. Xitaa qolka uu qof jiran ka baxay, waad ka qaadi kartaa.

3
00:00:14,072 --> 00:00:25,324
10 ilaa 12 maalmood kadib: qandho, duray, qufac iyo indho cas. Laba ilaa afar maalmood kadib, finan ayaa wejiga ka bilaabma oo jirka oo dhan ku faafa. Ogow: maqaarka madow, finanku si fudud uma muuqdaan.

4
00:00:25,424 --> 00:00:30,035
Qofku wuxuu faafin karaa afar maalmood ka hor intaanay finanku soo bixin, isagoon ogeyn inuu jiran yahay.

5
00:00:30,135 --> 00:00:43,017
Jadeecadu waxay keeni kartaa oof-wareen, shuban, barar maskaxda iyo indho la'aan. Oo waxaa intaas ka sii daran: waxay tirtirtaa xusuusta habdhiska difaaca. Carruurta jadeecada qaaday waxay lumiyeen 11% ilaa 73% unugyadii difaaca.

6
00:00:43,117 --> 00:00:47,473
Adduunka, hal sannad: 11 milyan oo xaaladood iyo 95,000 dhimasho.

7
00:00:47,573 --> 00:00:57,236
Soomaaliya, jadeecada, oof-wareenka iyo shubanka ayaa wada sababa ku dhawaad 43% dhimashada carruurta. Kismaayo kaliya, qiyaastii 680 qof ayaa jadeeco u dhintay.

8
00:00:57,336 --> 00:01:08,696
Minnesota, Maraykanka: tallaalka carruurta Soomaalida wuxuu ka dhacay 92% ilaa 42%. UK-gana, ilmo ayaa jadeeco ugu dhintay Liverpool, dalkuna wuxuu lumiyay magaca 'dal jadeeco ka xor ah'.

9
00:01:08,796 --> 00:01:22,901
Maxaa sababay? Warar been ah oo sheegayay in tallaalka MMR uu keeno otisam. Daraasaddaas waxay ku salaysnayd 12 carruur ah oo keliya. Waa la buriyay. Daraasad Denmark ah oo 657,000 carruur ah: wax xiriir ah ma jiro.

10
00:01:23,001 --> 00:01:30,167
Jadeecadu waxay soo bandhigtaa meel kasta oo tallaal ka maqan yahay. Laba qiyaasood oo MMR ah ayaa ilmahaaga ilaaliya, UK-gana waa bilaash.

11
00:01:30,267 --> 00:01:33,908
Talo caafimaad maaha, la tasho dhakhtarkaaga. U dir waalid kale.
